Your hateful will splinters into the minds of those you torture, breaking them down. Each time you inflict Mind damage, the victim has a [8.0%, 12%, 14%, 16%, 18% (TL1-5)] chance of going mad for 3 turns unless they save against your Mindpower. The madness will lower the victim's Mind resistance by [12%, 20%, 26%, 29%, 32% (TL1-5)] and cause them to become confused (50% power), slowed (30% power), or stunned for the duration.
